cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "invariantset: maximal robust invariant sets for discrete-time linear systems"
abstract: >-
  Polytope algebra and the one-step-set recursion for the maximal robust
  invariant set of a discrete-time linear system with a bounded additive
  disturbance, with measured reporting of representation growth, iteration
  stalling and tolerance sensitivity. Research-grade; not flight-qualified,
  not certified, not approved for operational aerospace use.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
